                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  7,
                                            "text":  "Jeet started with one question: the jeet sold, but is he really out?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  7,
                                            "text":  "This sprint turned that question into a field tool."
                                        }
                                    ]
                   },
                   {
                       "id":  "lifecycle",
                       "kind":  "lifecycle",
                       "duration_seconds":  21,
                       "captions":  [
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  5,
                                            "text":  "So I built Jeet to reconstruct\nthe wallet\u0027s actual token lifecycle."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "Here is a real Solana case\nI anonymized for the demo."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  6,
                                            "text":  "Wallet A sold about 7.52 million tokens.\nIts balance actually hit zero."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  6,
                                            "text":  "At that point, Jeet could defensibly\nclassify the wallet as VERIFIED OUT."
                                        }
                                    ]
                   },
                   {
                       "id":  "reentry",
                       "kind":  "conclusion",
                       "duration_seconds":  20,
                       "captions":  [
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "But that was not the end of the story."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  7,
                                            "text":  "Jeet continued following the lifecycle and found\nWallet A later bought back almost 5.97 million tokens."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "The historical answer was true:\nthe wallet was out."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  5,
                                            "text":  "The current answer is different:\nRE-ENTERED. NOT OUT."
                                        }
                                    ]
                   },
                   {
                       "id":  "evidence",
                       "kind":  "evidence",
                       "duration_seconds":  16,
                       "captions":  [
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "That distinction is the point of Jeet Analyzer."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  8,
                                            "text":  "The Telegram bot reuses Jeet\u0027s jobs, budgets, access ledger, and protected reports."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "It does not create a second forensic engine or guess at ownership."
                                        }
                                    ]
                   },
                   {
                       "id":  "honesty",
                       "kind":  "honesty",
                       "duration_seconds":  9,
                       "captions":  [
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  4,
                                            "text":  "In this case, common control is NOT PROVEN."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "duration_seconds":  5,
                                            "text":  "Downstream relationship coverage\nis explicitly marked incomplete."
                                        }
                                    ]
                   },
